<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - SBC Warburg picks ten stocks for 97.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SBC Warburg picks ten stocks for 97.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg issued a list of ten UK stocks it expects to outperform during 1997, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The ten were British Aerospace Plc, British Land Plc, British Telecommunications Plc, building supplies group Caradon Plc, electrical retailer Dixons Group Plc, Independent Insurance Group Plc, Mercury Asset Management Group Plc, aero engine maker Rolls Royce Plc, insurance group Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Group Plc and supermarket operator J. Sainsbury Plc.  </p>
<p>Analysts at Warburg were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
